   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mill Town Flood**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Born To Be With You**: back after 105 archived shows (739 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **A Face In The Crowd**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Key Signator**: back after 52 archived shows (428 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Somehow Tonight**: back after 354 archived shows (2464 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **The Beginning of the End**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-08-08.mk4v.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 156 min [1]\n- **billystrings2026-08-08.aud.mp3**: audience recording; 20 songs; 159 min [2]\n- **BMFS2026-08-08**: source not stated; 0 songs; 154 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- At one point the full band, minus Alex, gathered around a single microphone [3]\n- One song had last been played on 2023-02-26, a gap of 271 shows, the longest gap noted [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-08-08.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]. Also: Transferred as wav via Sound Studio and xACT, then converted to 24/96 flac [1]\n- **billystrings2026-08-08.aud.mp3**: taped by Dave Mason; transferred by Dave Mason; source: aud [2]\n- **BMFS2026-08-08**: taped by Tony DeStefanis; source: Schoeps mk22 > nbobs > Mixpre 6ii [3]",
